OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Flargely dry but cloudy. One or two
OL,7,Fshowers possible, but these are likely
OL,8,Fto remain across the Pennines. South-
OL,9,Fwesterly wind easing overnight,
OL,10,Falthough staying breezy across high
OL,11,Fground.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FDry with sunny spells for
OL,14,Fmost during the morning, although
OL,15,Fshowers of rain persist across the
OL,16,FPennines. Clouding over with outbreaks
OL,17,Fof rain, possibly heavy at times,
OL,18,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
