OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWet
OL,6,Fand grey on Wednesday, becoming drier
OL,7,Fand more settled to end the week,
OL,8,Falthough overnight rain Thursday into
OL,9,FFriday may be heavy at times. Near or
OL,10,Fslightly above-average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
